# Copy the lines you need to demo/.env.local (git-ignored) and uncomment them.
# The public demo build (GitHub Pages) sets only one terminology variable,
# VITE_OPT_IN_FHIR_BASE_URL, taken from the repository variable
# DEMO_OPT_IN_FHIR_BASE_URL: the demo contacts that server only after the
# visitor's separate consent. VITE_* values are compiled into the built page
# and are visible to anyone who opens it: never put secrets here.

# FHIR terminology server for LOINC, ICD-10-GM, OPS and ATC (local previews
# only). Example: HL7 Deutschland's public server, for development and
# non-commercial research only; read https://tx.fhir.de/de/terms and
# https://tx.fhir.de/de/licenses first.
# VITE_FHIR_BASE_URL=https://tx.fhir.de/fhir
# SNOMED CT over FHIR, only with an Affiliate Licence for this edition (in
# Germany via BfArM/MLDS):
# VITE_SNOMED_EDITION=11000274103
# VITE_SNOMED_EDITION_VERSION=20260815

# Public demo: FHIR server for an optional live search of LOINC, ICD-10-GM, OPS
# and ATC that each visitor must switch on with separate consent. Ignored when
# VITE_FHIR_BASE_URL, or VITE_SNOWSTORM_BASE_URL with VITE_SNOWSTORM_BRANCH, is
# set (VITE_SNOMED_EDITION takes effect only together with VITE_FHIR_BASE_URL).
# The consent does not cover SNOMED CT; see the separate unlock below. Offered
# only for a host whose operator demo/index.html names in a
# [data-live-search-operator] block.
# VITE_OPT_IN_FHIR_BASE_URL=https://tx.fhir.de/fhir
# Optional, only together with VITE_OPT_IN_FHIR_BASE_URL: SNOMED CT edition
# that visitors who have switched on the live search can unlock with a licence
# self-declaration (they confirm their own Affiliate Licence and use in
# Germany). Only 11000274103 (German National Edition) is accepted, because
# the self-declaration in demo/index.html describes that edition alone; any
# other value offers no unlock and logs a warning in the browser console.
# Leave unset in public builds until BfArM has confirmed this approach.
# VITE_OPT_IN_SNOMED_EDITION=11000274103
# VITE_OPT_IN_SNOMED_EDITION_VERSION=20260815

# SNOMED CT via Snowstorm, likewise only with an Affiliate Licence for the
# edition served.
# Optional Snowstorm URL. Use only when the target permits this browser origin
# through CORS. This is required to enable Snowstorm.
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_BASE_URL=https://snowstorm.example.test/snowstorm/snomed-ct

# Required together with VITE_SNOWSTORM_BASE_URL: the branch of the edition
# your licence covers. Without it SNOMED CT stays disabled and the console
# warns; MAIN holds the International Edition.
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_BRANCH=MAIN/SNOMEDCT-DE

# Optional Snowstorm request settings.
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_LANGUAGE=de
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_LANGUAGE_STRATEGY=header
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_DEFAULT_ECL=< 404684003
# VITE_SNOWSTORM_MAX_RESULTS=15
